# Supabase Configuration for Act Service
# Connect your real Supabase project:
# 1. Open your Supabase Dashboard: https://supabase.com/dashboard/project/_/settings/api
# 2. Copy the Project URL (e.g. https://xyzcompany.supabase.co)
# 3. Copy the anon / public key (e.g. eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9...)
# In AI Studio, configure these via the Secrets panel.
SUPABASE_URL=https://your-project.supabase.co
SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=your-supabase-anon-key
